{:edb/db-before-t 2301 :edb/db-after-t 2302 :edb/tx-data [[13194139535614 50 #inst "2026-10-14T18:43:57.526Z" 13194139535614 17592186045443 true] [17592186059578 1071 "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n![](images/4d/4d90e81043121495ae8bb7742400b2c9e705cb7d706f553a6ab2aec44b35d017.png)" 13194139535614 17592186045443 false] [17592186059578 1071 "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cc|c}5 & -4 & -12 \\\\ 3 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$" 13194139535614 17592186045443 true] [17592186059578 1074 "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and $y,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n\n$$\n\\begin{cases}5x-4y=-12 \\\\ 3x+y=1.\\end{cases}\n$$" 13194139535614 17592186045443 true] [17592186059578 1074 "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and $y,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n![](images/3e/3e7f783023405be3ea79a740998fefac3a6ea909e9903f5ea300a9234ae63003.png)" 13194139535614 17592186045443 false] [17592186059579 1071 "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n![](images/d8/d89417b7eb2d000bbd81fcf4a89ca7eaa5529fc56d9b41bf6e8bb237d2eb9e16.png)" 13194139535614 17592186045443 false] [17592186059579 1071 "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{cases}\\frac{c}{2}=a \\\\ 5+3b-a=4c \\\\ d=1\\end{cases}\n$$" 13194139535614 17592186045443 true] [17592186059579 1074 "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $a,b,c,d$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n![](images/93/93874fa93cfd9ef3df1492bbc35056c2381157740d8ca26b475474faf54ee4d1.png)\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{ccc|c}-1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n![](images/83/8356d9148bc06d76a5aee41e4a07651c43d94b2496d9542eb8b6e01ee52ea161.png)" 13194139535614 17592186045443 false] [17592186059579 1074 "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $a,b,c,d$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n$$\n\\begin{cases}-a+0b+\\frac{1}{2}c+0d=0 \\\\ -a+3b-4c+0d=-5 \\\\ 0a+0b+0c+d=1\\end{cases}\n$$\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n\\left[\\begin{array}{cccc|c}-1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 0 & -5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1 & 1\\end{array}\\right]\n$$" 13194139535614 17592186045443 true]] :edb/tempids {} :edb/committed false :edb/speculative true}
